    <guid isPermaLink="false">681c7c6d24f85593469266e9</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 08 May 2025 09:45:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎收听「躺赢人生」，人生就是在正确的地方躺着。</span></p><p><span>本期节目是「躺赢人生」和「</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6811d99f31d8c26e00a59bea?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlYjdmNzNlMGRiZWQyMjI3MmNlYTU1MiJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6811d99f31d8c26e00a59bea?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlYjdmNzNlMGRiZWQyMjI3MmNlYTU1MiJ9"><span>小美好</span></a><span>」的串台节目。</span></p><p><span>我们深度探讨了过去半年我做的两件颠覆过往人生，重塑幸福生活的小事——</span></p><p><span>放弃时间管理，删掉 TO Do List.</span></p><p><span>正所谓——</span></p><p><span>优秀的创作者做事，真正的艺术家生活。</span></p><p><span>放弃 To DO ，立地成佛。</span></p><p><strong><span>本期嘉宾</span></strong></p><p><span>香菇小姐（播客：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6811d99f31d8c26e00a59bea?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlYjdmNzNlMGRiZWQyMjI3MmNlYTU1MiJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6811d99f31d8c26e00a59bea?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlYjdmNzNlMGRiZWQyMjI3MmNlYTU1MiJ9"><span>小美好</span></a><span>）</span></p><p><span>躺赢君公众号：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/T3HBHiQdIcFZjab4wyV8CA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/T3HBHiQdIcFZjab4wyV8CA"><span>躺赢君</span></a></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjX_TOLRU31Ux3wmhT1PTytfgXsZ.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FilIxbl67jo6dfz9BphfBiu2yo_6.jpg"></figure><p><strong><span>免责声明</span></strong></p><p><span>本播客所有内容均不构成任何投资建议。市场有风险，入市需谨慎。请您根据自身情况对相关内容进行独立评估，依据相关内容行事，后果自负。</span></p>]]></description>
